Bazel is a build tool that builds code quickly and reliably. It is used
to build the majority of Google's software.

This is the LTS 9 series. pkgsrc's devel/bazel is 6.4.0, which cannot
build projects that ask for a newer Bazel, such as mozc 3.x.

Upstream does not support NetBSD; this package carries the patches that
add it alongside the FreeBSD and OpenBSD cases already in the tree.
